 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.17,
   "end": 2.001,
   "text": "What if the Eiffel Tower"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.051,
   "end": 4.038,
   "text": "was made of human bones?"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.088,
   "end": 5.84,
   "text": "The real tower is"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.891,
   "end": 9.237,
   "text": "7,300 tonnes of iron."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.287,
   "end": 11.744,
   "text": "Bone is about four times lighter."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.794,
   "end": 14.095,
   "text": "Built in the same shape from bone,"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.146,
   "end": 17.1,
   "text": "it would weigh about 1,800 tonnes."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.15,
   "end": 20.652,
   "text": "That's about 250,000 skeletons."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.702,
   "end": 22.298,
   "text": "Where would Paris get them?"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.348,
   "end": 24.179,
   "text": "Right under its streets."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.229,
   "end": 26.451,
   "text": "The Catacombs hold the bones"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.501,
   "end": 28.41,
   "text": "of six million people."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.461,
   "end": 30.997,
   "text": "That's enough for 24 towers."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.047,
   "end": 32.799,
   "text": "So, would it stand?"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.849,
   "end": 35.725,
   "text": "Pound for pound, bone is nearly"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.775,
   "end": 38.076,
   "text": "as strong as the tower's iron."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.126,
   "end": 39.8,
   "text": "But it's much bendier,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.85,
   "end": 41.838,
   "text": "so it would sway in the wind."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.888,
   "end": 44.528,
   "text": "And the rain would slowly rot it away."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.578,
   "end": 46.801,
   "text": "Follow for more what-ifs."
  }
 ],
